# Paths that must never be in a published tree, in its history, or on disk beside it.
#
# Copy this to .publish-never-ship (gitignored) and list the REAL paths. The real file is
# never committed: a list of private document names is itself private.
#
# tools/preflight_publish.sh reads it. Without it the never-publish check reports SKIP and
# the run ends PREFLIGHT PARTIAL, never PASS.
#
# Format:
#   - one path prefix per line, matched case-folded at the repository root and at any depth
#     (docs/PRIVATE_ matches docs/PRIVATE_NOTES.md and aosp/docs/PRIVATE_x.md)
#   - a line starting with '+' is an allowlist entry: an exact path that may ship even
#     though a prefix matches it
#   - '#' starts a comment; blank lines are ignored
#
# docs/legal/, docs/hosting/, any *_MASTER_DOC.md and any AGENTS.md are built into the
# script and need not be listed.
#
# Examples of the FORM (placeholders, not real names):

docs/INTERNAL_NOTES.md
docs/DEPLOY_
private/
notes/todo.md

+docs/legal/PUBLISHED_FINDINGS.md
